","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"耀","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015:m0255"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yu","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-yu","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015:m0255","quote":"耀"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_A","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yu","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-yu","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015","quote":"　　瑜字仲異，以恭義校尉始領兵眾。是時賓客諸將多江西人，瑜虛心綏撫，得其歡心。建安九年，領丹楊太守，為眾所附，至萬餘人。加綏遠將軍。十一年，與周瑜共討麻、保二屯，破之。後從權拒曹公於濡須，權欲交戰，瑜說權持重，權不從，軍果無功。遷奮威將軍，領郡如故，自溧陽徙屯牛渚。瑜以永安人饒助為襄安長，無錫人顏連為居巢長，使招納廬江二郡，各得降附。濟陰人馬普篤學好古，瑜厚禮之，使二府將吏子弟數百人就受業，遂立學官，臨饗講肄。是時諸將皆以軍務為事，而瑜好樂墳典，雖在戎旅，誦聲不絕。年三十九，建安二十年卒。瑜五子：彌、熙、耀、曼、紘。曼至將軍，封侯。","source_term":"瑜五子：彌、熙、耀、曼、紘"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu051-yu-2","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-yu","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yu","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015:m0255"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015:m0255","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-yu:line015:m0255"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-051-yu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences"